    "lines": [
      {
        "speaker": "Reporter",
        "text": "Our top story tonight: a man has been found guilty of fraud after a six-week trial.",
        "es": "Nuestra noticia principal de esta noche: un hombre ha sido declarado culpable de fraude tras un juicio de seis semanas."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Lawyer",
        "text": "That's right. The jury took only two days to reach a unanimous verdict. The defendant was accused of stealing over a million pounds from elderly clients.",
        "es": "Así es. El jurado tardó solo dos días en alcanzar un veredicto unánime. El acusado fue acusado de robar más de un millón de libras a clientes ancianos."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Reporter",
        "text": "What sentence is he likely to receive?",
        "es": "¿Qué condena es probable que reciba?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Lawyer",
        "text": "Fraud on this scale usually carries a prison sentence of several years. However, the judge will consider mitigating factors, such as his previous good character.",
        "es": "Un fraude de esta magnitud suele conllevar una pena de varios años. Sin embargo, el juez considerará atenuantes, como su buena conducta previa."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Reporter",
        "text": "Will he appeal?",
        "es": "¿Apelará?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Lawyer",
        "text": "His barrister has already said they intend to lodge an appeal. They claim that crucial evidence was ruled inadmissible.",
        "es": "Su abogado ya ha dicho que piensan presentar un recurso. Afirman que se declaró inadmisible una prueba crucial."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Reporter",
        "text": "How do victims get compensation in a case like this?",
        "es": "¿Cómo reciben compensación las víctimas en un caso como este?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Lawyer",
        "text": "The court can order the offender to pay compensation, and a separate civil case may be brought against him. Victims have the right to seek damages.",
        "es": "El tribunal puede ordenar al condenado que pague una indemnización y se puede iniciar un proceso civil aparte. Las víctimas tienen derecho a reclamar daños y perjuicios."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Reporter",
        "text": "Thank you. The sentencing hearing will take place next month.",
        "es": "Gracias. La vista de condena tendrá lugar el mes que viene."
      }
    ],
